tgbot-cpp
------------------------------------------
C++ library for Telegram bot API

Runtime requirements:
  cygwin-3.6.12-1
  libTgBot-devel-1.13-1bl1
  libTgBot1.13-1.13-1bl1
  libboost-devel-1.66.0-1
  libboost_system1.66-1.66.0-1
  libcurl-devel-8.23.0-1
  libcurl4-8.23.0-1
  libgcc1-14.4.0-1
  libstdc++6-14.4.0-1
  nlohmann_json-3.12.0-1bl3
  pkg-config-3.0.10-1

Build requirements:
(besides corresponding -devel packages)
  binutils-2.47-1
  cmake-4.4.5-1
  cygport-0.37.12-1
  gcc-g++-14.4.0-1
  libboost-devel-1.66.0-1
  libcurl-devel-8.23.0-1
  libgtest-devel-1.18.0-1bl1
  ninja-1.13.2-1
  nlohmann_json-3.12.0-1bl3

Canonical website:
  https://github.com/reo7sp/tgbot-cpp

Canonical download:
  https://github.com/reo7sp/tgbot-cpp/archive/refs/tags/v1.13.tar.gz

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack tgbot-cpp-1.13-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./tgbot-cpp-1.13-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/tgbot-cpp-1.13-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/tgbot-cpp-1.13-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libTgBot1.13-1.13-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libTgBot-devel-1.13-X.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

